#### 26.2.5 \(P(x)\!+\!Q(x)\!\!=\!\!1\)

\[\begin{array}{l}P(-x)\!=\!\!Q(x)\\ A(x)\!\!=\!\!2P(x)\!\!-\!1\end{array}\]

